WS | Americas | &#39;<b>Miserable failure</b>&#39; links to Bush</a></h3><div class="s"><div class="kv" style="margin-bottom:2px"><cite>news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/americas/3298443.stm</cite><span class="flc"> - <a href="/url?q=http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search%3Fq%3Dcache:qzjUYFyq_F4J:http://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/americas/3298443.stm%252Bmiserable%2Bfailure%26hl%3Den%26ct%3Dclnk&amp;sa=U&amp;ei=oHAjUdL2A6n2igLR9oCQCA&amp;ved=0CD4QIDAI&amp;usg=AFQjCNFyJasDsvODCDemvL0Oy1IF21WnEw">Cached</a></span></div><span class="st">Dec 7, 2003 <b>...</b> Web users manipulate a popular search engine so an unflattering description <br>  leads to the president&#39;s page.</span><br></div></li><li class="g"><h3 class="r"><a href="/url?q=http://www.ru.org/economics/capitalism-a-miserable-failure.html&amp;sa=U&amp;ei=oHAjUdL2A6n2igLR9oCQCA&amp;ved=0CEEQFjAJ&amp;usg=AFQjCNG-Ac4vA8jWUL-vVXvjcI1hiG7wRg">Capitalism: a <b>Miserable Failure</b> | Economics</a></h3><div class="s"><div class="kv" style="margin-bottom:2px"><cite>www.ru.org/economics/capitalism-a-<b>miserable</b>-<b>failure</b>.html</cite><span class="flc"> - <a href="/url?q=http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search%3Fq%3Dcache:ClllJJP-uEgJ:http://www.ru.org/economics/capitalism-a-miserable-failure.html%252Bmiserable%2Bfailure%26hl%3Den%26ct%3Dclnk&amp;sa=U&amp;ei=oHAjUdL2A6n2igLR9oCQCA&amp;ved=0CEIQIDAJ&amp;usg=AFQjCNH09tNvt1pge-0tG7vW2k63Tcqahg">Cached</a> - <a href="/search?hl=en&amp;ie=UTF-8&amp;q=related:www.ru.org/economics/capitalism-a-miserable-failure.html+miserable+failure&amp;tbo=1&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=oHAjUdL2A6n2igLR9oCQCA&amp;ved=0CEMQHzAJ">Similar</a></span></div><span class="st">Capitalism has <b>failed</b> to bring about a good life for most of the people of the world <br>  and it is time to face the truth.</span><br></div></li></ol></div></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:17px;overflow:hidden"><div style="font-size:16px;padding:0 8px 1px">Searches related to <b>miserable failure</b></div><table bor